"P2372367204" "You've made a name for yourself in the Rogue Isles, {VillainName}, but you're on my turf now. I need someone to get into a Longbow advanced command post and blow it sky high. Trouble is, you've got to do it fast. If Longbow gets their data transferred to another facility, it's no good to me. You only have 1 hour to blow that command center. <br><br><color red>Don't accept this task if you can't handle heroes who want you dead.</color>"
