// IntroString :
"P3356923182" "Longbow is doing their best to push Arachnos out of Siren's Call, and I hate to admit it, but they're not doing a bad job. We have to attack them from every angle. Longbow has a warehouse in the area where they're storing a bunch of their supplies. If you could take out that supply depot, it would help us a lot. Do it quickly though, before they can sound the alert. You only have an hour. <br><br><color red>Don't accept this task if you can't handle heroes who want you dead.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1322228397" "Take out the Longbow supply depot"
// SendOffString :
"P1939904854" "Take out everyone inside that supply depot. That'll shut it down for good."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P991234925" "Defeat all agents in depot"
